1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:02,315
Booking a shortlet in Lagos

2
00:00:02,335 --> 00:00:04,097
shouldn't feel like a gamble.

3
00:00:04,277 --> 00:00:06,327
On HAMLET, every home is visited

4
00:00:06,327 --> 00:00:08,132
before it goes live.

5
00:00:08,152 --> 00:00:09,432
We check who owns it,

6
00:00:09,452 --> 00:00:11,082
that the photos are real,

7
00:00:11,102 --> 00:00:12,649
and the backup power.

8
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:14,164
So how does booking work?

9
00:00:14,184 --> 00:00:15,722
Four simple steps.

10
00:00:15,832 --> 00:00:17,562
Step one. Search.

11
00:00:17,582 --> 00:00:18,792
Pick an area, your dates,

12
00:00:18,812 --> 00:00:20,277
and how many guests.

13
00:00:20,387 --> 00:00:21,417
Step two.

14
00:00:21,437 --> 00:00:22,567
Choose a place you love

15
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:24,037
and send a request.

16
00:00:24,037 --> 00:00:25,711
You don't pay anything yet.

17
00:00:25,821 --> 00:00:28,071
Step three. The host checks the dates.

18
00:00:28,071 --> 00:00:29,396
If they say yes,

19
00:00:29,396 --> 00:00:30,966
you have forty-eight hours

20
00:00:30,966 --> 00:00:33,613
to pay, safely, through Paystack.

21
00:00:33,723 --> 00:00:34,953
The price you see already

22
00:00:34,973 --> 00:00:35,923
includes our fee.

23
00:00:35,923 --> 00:00:38,123
Cleaning and a refundable

24
00:00:38,123 --> 00:00:39,598
caution deposit are shown

25
00:00:39,598 --> 00:00:41,153
before you request.

26
00:00:41,173 --> 00:00:42,602
No surprises.

27
00:00:42,712 --> 00:00:43,842
Step four.

28
00:00:43,862 --> 00:00:45,567
Once your stay is confirmed,

29
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:47,237
your exact address and arrival

30
00:00:47,237 --> 00:00:49,498
guide unlock in your account.

31
00:00:49,608 --> 00:00:51,213
Booking from abroad?

32
00:00:51,233 --> 00:00:54,133
You can see prices in pounds or dollars.

33
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:55,408
And if you have questions about

34
00:00:55,408 --> 00:00:57,989
an area, just ask Horatio.

35
00:00:58,099 --> 00:00:59,554
Verified stays.

36
00:00:59,574 --> 00:01:00,704
Simple booking.

37
00:01:00,724 --> 00:01:03,198
Find your stay at hamlet dot rest.
